<title>USA: Hadco begins tender for Zycon.</title>
<headline>Hadco begins tender for Zycon.</headline>
<dateline>SALEM, N.H. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hadco Corp said it has begun its previously-announced tender offer for all outstanding shares of Zycon Corp at $18 per share.</p>
<p>The company said the offer is scheduled to expire at midnight on January 9, unless extended.</p>
<p>Consummation of the offer is subject to the valid tender of a majority of shares outstanding, the expiration or termination of all applicable waiting periods and other customary conditions.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
